    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"At SONAM, what stood out for me was the team. I like the way the team works. Most of them are highly qualified and dedicated to the place,\" said Dr Abdallah Mahmoud Abdallah Ali, of Aswan University Hospital as he reflected on his experience at Aga Khan University School of Nursing and Midwifery (AKU-SONAM).",
